      "description": "平面列表条目，以细线与文字建立层级；文章少于 6 篇时退为两列，主题与日期内联在摘要下方。",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-row\"><span class=\"ds-number\">01</span><div><h2><a href=\"/articles/socratic-tutor-skill\">苏格拉底式导师 Skill 内容 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h2><p>socratic-tutor Skill 内容转载</p><p class=\"ds-meta\"><a href=\"/?tag=转载\">转载</a><time datetime=\"2026-11-11\">2026.11.11</time></p></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:48px minmax(0,1fr) 112px;padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule, #344546);color:var(--foreground, #e6eee8);font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif}.ds-number,.ds-row time{font:13px/1.8 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace;color:var(--muted, #a6b9b1)}.ds-row h2{margin:0;font-size:21px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.55}.ds-row a{color:var(--accent, #c6ea81);text-decoration:none}.ds-row a span{display:inline-block;opacity:0;transform:translateX(-3px);transition:opacity 180ms,transform 180ms}.ds-row a:hover span,.ds-row a:focus-visible span{opacity:1;transform:none}.ds-row p{margin:11px 30px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted, #a6b9b1)}.ds-row a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent, #c6ea81);outline-offset:5px}.ds-meta{display:flex;gap:12px;margin:10px 0 0;font:12px/1.8 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace;color:var(--muted, #a6b9b1)}.ds-meta a{color:var(--muted, #a6b9b1);text-decoration:none}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Code block",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "code-copy",
      "description": "代码块头部条：语言标签 + 换行开关 + 复制全文；长行折行、超长块折叠。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-code\"><div class=\"ds-code-bar\"><span>typescript</span><span class=\"ds-code-actions\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-text-wrap lucide-wrap-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 16-3 3 3 3\"></path><path d=\"M3 12h14.5a1 1 0 0 1 0 7H13\"></path><path d=\"M3 19h6\"></path><path d=\"M3 5h18\"></path></svg>换行</button><button><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg>复制全文</button></span></div><pre><span class=\"kw\">const</span> answer = <span class=\"num\">42</span>\n<span class=\"kw\">export</span> <span class=\"kw\">function</span> <span class=\"fn\">read</span>(path) { <span class=\"cm\">/* … */</span> }</pre></div>",
      "css": ".ds-code{border:1px solid var(--rule,#344546);border-radius:3px;background:var(--code,#0e1d1e);color:var(--foreground,#e6eee8);overflow:hidden}.ds-code-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:5px 8px 5px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule,#344546);font:11px/1.6 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace;color:var(--muted,#a6b9b1)}.ds-code-actions{display:flex;gap:6px}.ds-code-actions button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:24px;padding:0 8px;border:1px solid var(--rule,#344546);border-radius:3px;background:var(--code,#0e1d1e);color:var(--muted,#a6b9b1);font:12px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-code-actions button:hover,.ds-code-actions button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--accent,#c6ea81);color:var(--accent,#c6ea81)}.ds-code pre{margin:0;padding:20px 22px;font:0.85em/1.8 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-code .kw{color:var(--syntax-keyword,#c7a6e8)}.ds-code .num{color:var(--syntax-number,#ecc488)}.ds-code .fn{color:var(--syntax-function,#87cddd)}.ds-code .cm{color:var(--syntax-comment,#91a69b)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Back to top",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "back-to-top",
      "description": "滚过 600px 后从右下角淡入的回到顶部按钮，箭头为 lucide ArrowUp。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-btt-wrap\"><button class=\"ds-btt\" aria-label=\"回到顶部\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 7-7 7 7\"></path><path d=\"M12 19V5\"></path></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-btt-wrap{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;padding:24px}.ds-btt{width:38px;height:38px;border:1px solid var(--rule,#344546);border-radius:3px;background:var(--background,#132324);color:var(--muted,#a6b9b1);font:14px/1 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color 180ms,color 180ms,transform 100ms}.ds-btt:hover{border-color:var(--accent,#c6ea81);color:var(--accent,#c6ea81)}.ds-btt:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-btt:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#c6ea81);outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-btt{width:36px;height:36px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mixed article body",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "中英混排正文：英文衬线、中文无衬线，标题无衬线，代码等宽。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-reading\"><h2>Building with care</h2><p>一个安静的写作空间。A quiet space for ideas, careful experiments, and the things we learn along the way.</p><p>中英混排时 <code>const value = 42</code> 与 CJK 字符由浏览器逐字选字体。</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-reading{font-family:var(--font-reading-serif,Lora),-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.95;color:var(--foreground,#e6eee8)}.ds-reading h2{font-family:var(--sans,-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif);font-size:26px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.5;margin:40px 0 18px}.ds-reading h2:first-child{margin-top:0}.ds-reading p{margin:24px 0}.ds-reading code{font:0.85em/1.8 var(--mono,\"SFMono-Regular\",Consolas,\"Liberation Mono\",monospace);background:var(--code,#0e1d1e);border:1px solid var(--rule,#344546);border-radius:3px;padding:2px 5px}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-reading{font-size:16px}.ds-reading h2{font-size:24px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "开发者的编辑桌",
    "overview": "一个安静、清晰、精确的个人写作空间。深青墨底色承托文字，浅草绿标记当前位置与可进入的内容；浅色主题则像雾白纸上的绿墨。路径式面包屑、等宽日期与手写签名共同传达开发者气质，中文排版保留温度。\n\n整体平面、细线分区，组件克制。文章索引依靠列对齐与横向分隔线组织信息，长文依靠有限行宽、宽松行距和清晰标题层级组织阅读。空白是布局的一部分，内容较少时无需填满屏幕。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "深青墨与雾白纸双主题，绿色承担主要强调。",
      "系统中文无衬线字体搭配等宽的路径、编号与日期。",
      "桌面侧栏与平面文章索引；移动端横向导航与纵向条目。",
      "细分隔线、微圆角、短促状态反馈，无悬浮卡片层级。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Pair Rule",
        "body": "使用前景、背景和交互状态的同主题配对；新增样式引用现有语义变量，不将深色主题的浅草绿直接用于浅色正文链接。",
        "section": "Colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Hierarchy Rule",
        "body": "保持正文宽松、辅助文字收敛，延续现有的中等字重层级；不要把导航或日期提升为大号展示文字。",
        "section": "Typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reading Width Rule",
        "body": "索引利用工作区宽度，文章正文保留最大阅读栏；长代码和表格在自身容器内横向滚动，不撑宽整个页面。",
        "section": "Layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "延续平面关系，用细线与色调变化区分区域；不要为现有文章条目添加投影、玻璃模糊或浮起卡片。",
        "section": "Elevation & Depth"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 使用现有语义色变量，同时维护深色与浅色主题。",
      "**Do** 保留列对齐、细线分区及正文最大阅读栏，让内容建立层级。",
      "**Do** 将路径、编号、日期和代码交给等宽字体，中文阅读交给系统无衬线字体。",
      "**Do** 同步维护悬停、键盘焦点、当前项和减少动态效果的状态。",
      "**Do** 根据实际内容隐藏次要列、调整日期位置，延续现有移动端行为。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 将文章索引改成带投影的大圆角卡片，或用装饰填满空白。",
      "**Don't** 将代码语法色扩展为全站 UI 配色，或混用两个主题的前景背景。",
      "**Don't** 隐藏键盘焦点，或让长代码、长链接与表格撑宽页面。",
      "**Don't** 将本文未实现的表单、弹窗和按钮变体视为既有组件规范。"
    ]
  }
}
